          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "text": "There isnt much to say except it just works! Printed on my P1S Printer, assembly was simple (maybe a more elastic belt for an easier assembly?) and works like a charm. Its made my scanning set up faster and easier and i couldnt be happier, defo buying the 120 kit next!",
