          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "text": "This holder is absolutely incredible! It’s honestly ridiculous how well thought out the design is… I tried a lot of the big brands currently producing holders and was left a little disappointed, this holder left me excited (and motivated) to scan all my negatives. The only thing I could see improvements on is the way in which any additional parts (film rollers) clip into place. On my first use I heard a slight cracking noise and it feels (somewhat) prone to snapping - in saying that none of the products are damaged and appear to work perfectly. Excited to see any other products this company comes out with.",
